# Managed by Ansible (watoom-code search_scope.yml). WatooM-Code's grep/glob run ripgrep, which honours this file for
# every project below this group. Each Godot job leaves a full project copy, so a game project held 13,595 files for
# 476 real ones and project-wide searches timed out (2026-11-20). Job logs and result.json stay searchable, and a
# search given an explicit path inside a skipped folder still works.
**/.godot/
**/.opencode/tmp/
**/.opencode/godot-game-out/*/project/
